<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Comprehensive Auto Services - Car Mantri</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Comprehensive Auto Services by Car Mantri: preventive maintenance, diagnostics, repairs, detailing, and emergency support for reliable vehicle performance."
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include("../partials/navbar") %>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Comprehensive Auto Services</h2>
        <p class="section-text">
          Car Mantri provides complete vehicle care designed for daily drivers,
          families, and business fleets. Our service model combines preventive
          maintenance, rapid diagnosis, transparent pricing, and certified
          workmanship so your vehicle remains safe and road-ready.
        </p>

        <div class="book-card" style="max-width: 100%; margin-top: 22px">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom: 10px; color: #111827">What Is Included</h3>
          <ul style="line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 18px; color: #1f2937">
            <li>Periodic maintenance plans: oil, filters, fluids, and tune-ups</li>
            <li>Engine and transmission diagnostics with digital scan reports</li>
            <li>Brake, suspension, steering, and safety-system inspections</li>
            <li>AC service, battery replacement, and electrical fault tracing</li>
            <li>Wheel alignment, balancing, and tire health checks</li>
            <li>Body, paint-touchup, and interior detailing support</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="book-card" style="max-width: 100%; margin-top: 18px">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom: 10px; color: #111827">Why Businesses Choose This</h3>
          <ul style="line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 18px; color: #1f2937">
            <li>Lower downtime through preventive servicing schedules</li>
            <li>Faster turnaround with priority workshop handling</li>
            <li>Single-point support for all common repair categories</li>
            <li>Transparent estimates and clear service records</li>
            <li>Consistent quality checks before delivery</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="book-card" style="max-width: 100%; margin-top: 18px">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom: 10px; color: #111827">How Our Process Works</h3>
          <p class="section-text" style="margin-bottom: 8px">
            1. Inspection and diagnosis with issue summary.
          </p>
          <p class="section-text" style="margin-bottom: 8px">
            2. Estimate approval with parts and labor split.
          </p>
          <p class="section-text" style="margin-bottom: 8px">
            3. Service execution by certified mechanics.
          </p>
          <p class="section-text" style="margin-bottom: 8px">
            4. Final quality check and test drive verification.
          </p>
          <p class="section-text" style="margin-bottom: 0">
            5. Delivery with maintenance advice for long-term performance.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <%- include("../partials/footer") %>
    <%- include("../partials/loginModal") %>
  </body>
</html>
